; FARO - battle picture of PINZARRO (56x56 = 7x7 tiles), BG art (4 shades, white = BG colour 0).
; Tiles in row-major order, NOT deduplicated: the map is sequential (tile r*7+c at row r, column c),
; placed at columns 12-18, rows 0-6 (GDD 3.1). Loaded into BG 128.. (battle slot <= 49).
; Flash on hit = rewrite the 49 map cells with the blank tile and back. When harness/pictures.py (E9)
; exists this becomes a .pic and gets deduplicated.
; 49 tiles. Generated from a script, then this file is the source of truth.

